                        Allen Wallis, Lot 89D156: AW—Chron,
                    July/August/September 1986. Limited Official Use.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d368-f2" n="2" xml:id="d368-f2-content">
                <p>The memorandum is attached but not printed. It raised the concern that sugar was
                    a growing issue in the political relations between the U.S. and Latin American countries.</p>
            </note>
